+# Acme Labs ideas
+
+Cafes and small restaurants reorder supplies by hand, from paper lists and supplier phone calls.
+Owners say it takes three to five hours a week and they still run out of oat milk.
+We could build an app that watches what sells and drafts the reorder for the owner to approve.
+Start with independent cafes in one city; charge per location per month.
