+JSON
+node interface/cli/mentura.mjs customers/ada write --venture wr-errors --input ~/wr-ada.json --as person
+printf '{ "id": "cy", ' > ~/ventures/wr-errors/customers/cy.json
+node interface/cli/mentura.mjs customers read --venture wr-errors
+node interface/cli/mentura.mjs customers/cy read --venture wr-errors # exits 1
+```
+
+```json
