+## Set up schemas
+
+Naive's equivalent of TypeScript is JSON Schema, and it is built in. Every record type has a schema in the framework's `schema/` directory, and every write through the router is checked against it. `create-venture` maps each record file to its schema in `.vscode/settings.json`, so VS Code, Cursor and other editors complete fields and flag mistakes as you type. `naive typegen` writes the route table and the MCP tools to `.naive/types/` for agents and code. See [Typegen and MCP](./typegen-and-mcp).
 
